```python
prompt = f'''
Answer the question using ONLY the numbered sources below. Cite sources as [1], [2], etc.
If the sources don't contain the answer, say so.

[1] {chunk_1_text}
[2] {chunk_2_text}
[3] {chunk_3_text}

Question: {user_question}
'''
```
This structure gives the model everything it needs: the instruction (how to behave), clearly delimited numbered sources (what to use), and the question (what to answer) — the same instruction/context/question separation the LLM engineering course's prompt-structure lessons emphasized generally.
